id: teamwork
name: Teamwork
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You are especially skilled in providing tactical support for your allies in combat.
text: >
  Teamwork: You are especially skilled in providing tactical support for your allies in combat.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: Double the maximum amount you can Ki Wager when using the United Attack Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When using the United Attack Maneuver, increase your targeted Ally’s Strike and Wound Rolls by 1(T) for that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) The United Attack's 1/4 of your Max Capacity twice over - and, joined to a Duel, its 1/10th on each Duel Clash (united-
# attack.mjs unitedWagerCap; chat.mjs submitDuelWager).
allow united.doubleWager;
# (2) A box in the United Attack's own window, ticked by default, once a Round: their Strike and Wound 1(T), your Tier, for that
# Attacking Maneuver (united-attack.mjs).
allow united.teamwork;
